{% endblock %}

{% block content %}

<a href="/" class="brand">The Zero Fog</a>
<button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle" onclick="toggleTheme()">Light</button>

<main class="content">

  <h1 class="ty-headline">You're on the list.</h1>

  <p class="ty-sub">Welcome to the early circle. The training drops in the next couple weeks - and your priority access is locked in.</p>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="steps-section">

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-title">Check your inbox right now.</p>
        <p class="step-text">Look for "ZeroFog" or "hello@thezerofog.com". Move it to your main inbox so the next emails (and the training link when it drops) reach you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-title">Mark it "not spam" if it lands wrong.</p>
        <p class="step-text">Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo all filter aggressively. One move to your main inbox and you're set.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step-card">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-body">
        <p class="step-title">Watch for the training link.</p>
        <p class="step-text">Waitlist members get the registration link before public registration opens. Plus first pick of training slots when it goes live.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="credibility">
    <p class="credibility-text">I work from home. For 3 years I ran on coffee and willpower. Brain fog, bad decisions, crashed by 2 PM every day. I tried everything - morning routines, productivity systems, supplements. None of it lasted. Then I found what was actually broken - and fixed it in weeks. This training is the thing I wish someone had showed me 3 years ago.</p>
    <p class="credibility-author">- Kirill, ZeroFog</p>
  </div>

  <div class="final-cta">
    <p>Check your email - I'll be in touch shortly.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="disclaimer">This is an educational wellness program, not medical treatment. Results vary.</p>

</main>

